  "title": "RIP Twitter 2006-2022",
  "htmlContent": "<!-- wp:image {\"id\":520029,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/elon-musk-twitter-2022-1024x538.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-520029\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On Nov 17, 2022, newly CEO and owner of Twitter, Elon Musk, tweeted a unusual tweet. The billion dollar man and founder/owner of Tesla posted a picture of the twitter icon on a tombstone. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/elonmusk/status/1593459801966538755?s=20u0026t=UbZKb2e2NQhh2TmY04kr3g\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/elonmusk/status/1593459801966538755?s=20&amp;t=UbZKb2e2NQhh2TmY04kr3g\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With a man who appears to be Elon on one knee holding up the peace symbol with the Twitter icon as his head. Many celebrities expressed it would be their last tweet and last time logging onto the platform. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":520019,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/310184343_2963114260660773_8143801961825207071_n.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-520019\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While others like Washington Heights female rapper, “Cardi B” began to troll with explicit pornography rap video content! Moments later tweeting she was hacked. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/iamcardib/status/1593461387052711936?s=20u0026t=o68DZAtppsQqz2aoTenKxQ\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/iamcardib/status/1593461387052711936?s=20&amp;t=o68DZAtppsQqz2aoTenKxQ\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/315662522_5580855552022179_6386989297045202409_n.mp4\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"embed-handler\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-embed-handler wp-block-embed-embed-handler\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttp://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/315662522_5580855552022179_6386989297045202409_n.mp4\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/315990256_5495071510622007_1074911403697072247_n.mp4\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"embed-handler\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-embed-handler wp-block-embed-embed-handler\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttp://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/315990256_5495071510622007_1074911403697072247_n.mp4\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While others like “The Rundown” during a Clubhouse room think the death of Twitter is a brilliant marketing scheme! “I think it’s going up” Twitter been around since 2006 and many of the users seem unhappy about the decision to close headquarters. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Founder of SpaceX Elon Musk recently laid off nearly half the social media company 7,500 workers. The employees who remained were given a 5pm est Thursday deadline to develop twitter 2.0 </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2022/11/17/technology/twitter-elon-musk-ftc.html?fbclid=IwAR24w1kfvcDsNghIB9VqfbHLrIcRbLRH8h_7dXisWjUhaTtS253sVon0Bm8\">According to an article published by the New York Times two people said</a>, resignations started to roll in. Hundreds of Twitter employees appeared to have decided to depart with three months of severance pay, the people said.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
